{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your soul\u2019s been nicked by El Diablo\u2014time to gun it back!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Free Demo Available Now!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demo is now live! Play today and help me reach more gamers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2b50\ufe0f 8 Steam Curators Recommend Day of Pixel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">So, Here\u2019s the Deal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ride a hand-drawn 1800s frontier: dusty Mexican deserts, sun-baked Texas plains, adobe towns in New Mexico, and portals into the underworld!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003150/extras/7768ea3c7b103f2bc809e78b5228892f.avif?t=1754448391\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play How You Like</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bounty Posters</strong>: Duel bandits, pocket pesos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crop Chaos</strong>: Grow staple grains\u2026 or unlock chocolate &amp; strawberry cow sprouts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Frontier Economy</strong>: Trade, run cantinas &amp; ranches, and brew potent elixirs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gunfights &amp; Demons</strong>: Join or break rival gangs, then leap into underworld boss battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Festivals &amp; Hijinks</strong> \u2013 music and food lined streets, impromptu mariachi duels, and Warrior sheep charging at midnight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Your Call, Partner</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No microtransactions. No clone-towns. Live your cowboy dream or follow El Diablo\u2019s twisted questline\u2014either way, the frontier\u2019s yours.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Built by One Mad Cowboy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Six years, three empanadas a day, and one friend on trumpet duty. I started this with no coding skill but could do art, so I learned. Now I\u2019ve got exploding Pepper Enemies and story unlike your boring Farming Games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Games For GAmersss Alwaysss!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2003150?t=1754448391","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003150/c969c16f3494d69483c50ecb054b5139bc0d82ea/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754448391","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003150/92850e702b74fe54c22435b0b69885ec60adc108/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754448391","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003150/92850e702b74fe54c22435b0b69885ec60adc108/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754448391","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2092370,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your soul\u2019s been nicked by El Diablo\u2014time to gun it back!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Free Demo Available Now!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demo is now live! Play today and help me reach more gamers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2b50\ufe0f 8 Steam Curators Recommend Day of Pixel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">So, Here\u2019s the Deal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ride a hand-drawn 1800s frontier: dusty Mexican deserts, sun-baked Texas plains, adobe towns in New Mexico, and portals into the underworld!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003150/extras/7768ea3c7b103f2bc809e78b5228892f.avif?t=1754448391\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play How You Like</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_pa